==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has reached 67 Million installs from players around the world! Celebrate this amazing milestone with special stages and events,<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On February 14th (11:00am) through February 28th, 2022 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Treasure Festivals Everyday!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6600|During this event, get increased Treasure Drop}} {{Color|#FF9900|Rates}} in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00FF|Treasure Festival}}, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#008000|'''even days (10/18, 10/20, 10/22, 10/24, 10/26, 10/28, 10/30)'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00FF|Empire of Cats}}, and on {{Color|#46BDC6|'''odd days (10/19, 10/21, 10/23, 10/25, 10/27, 10/29, 10/31)}} head to {{Color|#FF00FF|Into the Future}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|Cats of the Cosmos}} on {{Color|#0000FF|'''2/14, 2/17, 2/20, 2/23, and 2/26!'''}}

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} each day of the campaign!<br>
Don't miss a day for maximum Cat Food profit!

